    <description>P11 | A11-15, V11-10 | Quick action on the reservation: close its resource for a private activity. Without the custom permission Close_Resource_Private the user sees the V11-10 message and nothing is closed. With it, Apex P11_CloseResourcePrivate adds a blocking child reservation for the same range.</description>
